                              "fill": "$--foreground",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Artificial intelligence is rapidly transforming healthcare delivery and outcomes across multiple domains. In diagnostics, deep learning models now match or exceed radiologist accuracy in detecting conditions like diabetic retinopathy, lung cancer nodules, and breast cancer from medical imaging [1][2]. Google Health's AI system demonstrated 94.5% sensitivity in mammography screening, reducing false positives by 5.7% compared to human readers [3].",
