                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "h9Vmu",
                              "name": "aiP2",
                              "fill": "$--foreground",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "In drug discovery, AI has compressed the traditional 10-15 year development timeline significantly. Insilico Medicine's AI-discovered drug reached Phase II clinical trials in just 30 months from target identification [4]. Meanwhile, AlphaFold's protein structure predictions have been used by over 2 million researchers, accelerating understanding of disease mechanisms [5][6].",
                              "lineHeight": 1.65,
                              "fontFamily": "Geist",
