                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "rxfve",
                          "name": "Response Body",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "layout": "vertical",
                          "gap": 16,
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "ldPG3",
                              "name": "aiRTitle",
                              "fill": "$--foreground",
                              "content": "AI in Healthcare: Current Impact and Future Promise",
                              "fontFamily": "Geist",
                              "fontSize": 16,
                              "fontWeight": "600"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "lEZnK",
                              "name": "aiRP1",
                              "fill": "$--foreground",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Artificial intelligence is rapidly transforming healthcare delivery and outcomes across multiple domains. In diagnostics, deep learning models now match or exceed radiologist accuracy in detecting conditions like diabetic retinopathy, lung cancer nodules, and breast cancer from medical imaging [1][2]. Google Health's AI system demonstrated 94.5% sensitivity in mammography screening [3].",
                              "lineHeight": 1.65,
                              "fontFamily": "Geist",
                              "fontSize": "$--font-size-sm",
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "Dh73t",
                              "name": "aiRP2",
                              "fill": "$--foreground",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "In drug discovery, AI has compressed the traditional 10-15 year development timeline significantly. Insilico Medicine's AI-discovered drug ISM001-055 reached Phase II clinical trials in just 30 months [4]. Meanwhile, AlphaFold's protein structure predictions have been used by over 2 million researchers [5][6].",
                              "lineHeight": 1.65,
                              "fontFamily": "Geist",
                              "fontSize": "$--font-size-sm",
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "id": "gHUPY",
                              "name": "aiRP3",
                              "fill": "$--foreground",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Patient outcomes have shown measurable improvement where AI tools are deployed. A 2024 meta-analysis found that AI-assisted diagnosis reduced diagnostic errors by 26% across 45 studies [7]. Predictive models for sepsis detection have reduced mortality by 18-22% in hospitals using real-time AI monitoring [8][9].",
                              "lineHeight": 1.65,
                              "fontFamily": "Geist",
                              "fontSize": "$--font-size-sm",
                              "fontWeight": "normal"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
